# Deploy VPS (Vietnix 4GB)

**VPS không đủ RAM để `docker build` Next.js.** Mọi lần deploy phải build image trên máy dev (Windows + Docker Desktop), rồi đẩy image lên VPS qua `docker save` / `scp` / `docker load`.

## Lệnh chuẩn (Windows)

```powershell
$env:VPS_USER = "deploy"
$env:VPS_HOST = "14.225.211.205"
$env:VPS_PATH = "/opt/chapmee/app"
$env:NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL = "https://chapmee.com"
$env:NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL = "https://chapmee.com"
$env:NEXT_PUBLIC_S3_MEDIA_PUBLIC_BASE_URL = "https://media.chapmee.com"
npm run deploy:vps
```

Rollback: `npm run deploy:vps:rollback`

Runbook đầy đủ: `docs/VPS_BUILD_RUNBOOK.md`, `docs/DEPLOY_IMAGE_SAVE_LOAD.md`

## Cấm trên VPS (và cấm agent chạy qua SSH)

- `docker build`
- `docker compose build`
- `docker compose up --build`
- `docker compose -f docker-compose.production.yml build web`
- Upload tarball source rồi build trên VPS (`vps-sync-deploy-remote.sh`, `vps-upload.mjs` + build) — **chỉ dùng khi không có Docker local**

## Compose file đúng

| Mục đích | File |
|----------|------|
| Deploy image đã build sẵn | `docker-compose.prod.yml` + `CHAPMEE_WEB_IMAGE=chapmee-web:latest` |
| ~~Build trên VPS~~ | `docker-compose.production.yml` — **tránh** |

## Script đúng

- `scripts/deploy/deploy-local-to-vps.ps1` (Windows)
- `scripts/deploy/deploy-local-to-vps.sh` (Bash/WSL)

**Không** dùng `deploy-vps.ps1` (S3 migration cũ, build trên VPS), `vps-build-bg.mjs`, `vps-sync-deploy-remote.sh` trừ khi user nói rõ không có Docker local.

## Sau deploy

```powershell
ssh deploy@14.225.211.205 "curl -sf http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/health"
```

Không upload `.env.production` từ máy dev — env chỉ sửa trên VPS.
